    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc0 RNG JAM \u2014 BET BIG BALL HARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/bab0795aaa3dc4f4259ee88afee85f60.avif?t=1745507790\" width=616 height=776 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you tired of predictable (and let\u2019s be honest, predatory) sports games?</strong><br><strong>RNG JAM</strong> smashes together the energy of <strong>arcade basketball</strong> with the relentless replayability of a <strong>roguelite</strong> \u2014 then sprinkles in some <strong>high-stakes sports betting (purely fictional)</strong> for flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s 2-on-2 hoops meets calculated chaos. Every match is a fresh gamble, every run a wild ride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc0 <strong>2-on-2 Arcade Basketball Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/9fb633d1bc9bee544edc9e596963c600.poster.avif?t=1745507790\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/9fb633d1bc9bee544edc9e596963c600.webm?t=1745507790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/9fb633d1bc9bee544edc9e596963c600.mp4?t=1745507790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Inspired by the original arcade classic 2-on-2 basketball game everyone knows, but powered by pure true RNG and strategy. Dunk, pass, steal, and smack-talk your way through sweaty CPU opponents with <strong>high-flying, fast-paced action</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Roguelite Runs with Real Stakes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run starts with a <strong>randomly generated team</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/084835bf07e708008c6bfae5f7158593.poster.avif?t=1745507790\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/084835bf07e708008c6bfae5f7158593.webm?t=1745507790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/084835bf07e708008c6bfae5f7158593.mp4?t=1745507790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches, earn cash, and <strong>place bets between quarters</strong>.<br>Risk it all on wild odds or play it safe \u2014 just don\u2019t blow your bankroll before the final buzzer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/959ac93c0d6e1b28dd848e791aedd25a.poster.avif?t=1745507790\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/959ac93c0d6e1b28dd848e791aedd25a.webm?t=1745507790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/959ac93c0d6e1b28dd848e791aedd25a.mp4?t=1745507790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Money = Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack your earnings to <strong>buy powerups</strong> and upgrade your squad.<br>Do you go all-in on speed? Or stack your dunks to shatter backboards and egos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638030/extras/0728e2d1124fab29ccd714781bafec79.avif?t=1745507790\" width=345 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups currently include (more soon):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f9\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f RunGovy \u2013 increase turbo stat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc0 AmoxiSlam \u2013 increase dunk stat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 Thritalin \u2013 increase 3-pointer stat</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Harder Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game, the enemy teams get sweatier, saltier, and smarter. The CPU knows when its down in points, and gets more aggressive the gap becomes.<br>Upgrade wisely and manage your cash \u2014 because the <strong>CPU teams <i>don\u2019t*</i> miss</strong> once the stakes get high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*sometimes they still miss because that would make the game impossible.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Beat the Gauntlet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>6\u20138 increasingly brutal teams</strong> in a single run. Have yet to decide on the final game count per run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best resource managers, risk takers, and showboaters will survive <strong>to the end.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf89 Why You'll Love RNG JAM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc0 Non-stop arcade basketball, chaos dialed to 11</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Every run is unique \u2014 and full of <i>bad</i> decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb0 Gambling mechanics that are fun and fictional, not predatory, no in-game-transactions <u><strong>EVER</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Local multiplayer planned for 2026 Q4 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <i>AND EXPLOSIVE DUNKS</i> (obviously)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Development Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the dev logs as I continue to update the game on youtube. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
