ab29ccd714781bafec79.avif?t=1745507790\" width=345 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups currently include (more soon):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f9\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f RunGovy \u2013 increase turbo stat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc0 AmoxiSlam \u2013 increase dunk stat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 Thritalin \u2013 increase 3-pointer stat</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Harder Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game, the enemy teams get sweatier, saltier, and smarter. The CPU knows when its down in points, and gets more aggressive the gap becomes.<br>Upgrade wisely and manage your cash \u2014 because the <strong>CPU teams <i>don\u2019t*</i> miss</strong> once the stakes get high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*sometimes they still miss because that would make the game impossible.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Beat the Gauntlet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>6\u20138 increasingly brutal teams</strong> in a single run. Have yet to decide on the final game count per run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best resource managers, risk takers, and showboaters will survive <strong>to the end.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf89 Why You'll Love RNG JAM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc0 Non-stop arcade basketball, chaos dialed to 11</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Every run is unique \u2014 and full of <i>bad</i> decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb0 Gambling mechanics that are fun and fictional, not predatory, no in-game-transactions <u><strong>EVER</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Local multiplayer planned for 2026 Q4 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <i>AND EXPLOSIVE DUNKS</i> (obviously)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Development Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the dev logs as I continue to update the game on youtube. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
